      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARCHER THIRTEEN (8) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in four starts, including two wins and two placings. Placed last time (19.65) at this track in a OPEN, finishing third and beaten 1.3 lengths. Looks a leading chance on best. DODGEM JET (1) had been going along well winning a Grade 6 three back then placing at Q Lakeside before missing the frame latest when fourth (20.11) at this track. Well placed here and can atone this time. VENOMOUS MISS (7) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 6 winner three back (16.72) at Q Straight over 300m. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. RISK IT (5) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
